flowchart TD
    U[User] --> CF[CloudFront]
    CF --> FE[Static Web Frontend]
    FE --> C[Cognito]
    FE --> APIGW[API Gateway]
    APIGW --> L1[API Lambda]

    L1 --> DDB[(DynamoDB)]
    L1 --> S3[(S3 Documents)]

    S3 --> SQS[SQS Queue]
    SQS --> L2[Processing Lambda]
    L2 --> S3
    L2 --> DDB

    L1 --> CW[CloudWatch]
    L2 --> CW
